      "n": "BumperPlacement"
    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Imagine Meg Murry from <i>A Wrinkle In Time</i> wants to get rid of that titular wrinkle and turns to pharmaceuticals for help.",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "C'est quoi ton L'Engle, Madeleine ? ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "719859_1",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Lyrica est pour la fibromyalgie, que, selon les publicités, vous ne contractez que si vous possédez une boulangerie ou un atelier de poterie. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "719871_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "IntroAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "719862_1",
      "n": "ChoicesAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Caladryl soulage les démangeaisons causées par les piqûres d'insectes. Et quelle coïncidence, vraiment, parce que tu viens de te faire piquer ! ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "719869_1",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio2"
    },
    {
      "s": "\"Lispidol\" est un mot que j'ai inventé et je voulais VRAIMENT que vous le choisissiez. Alors je suis triste pour toi, mais heureux pour moi, tu sais ? ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "719867_2",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "The drug Retin-A has been clinically shown to reduce wrinkles.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "719864_1",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "There’s a place in Canada that’ll even give you a discount if you buy in bulk. I mean, that’s what I heard. From, you know, other people.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "719865_2",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Imagine Meg Murry from <i>A Wrinkle In Time</i> wants to get rid of that titular wrinkle and turns to pharmaceuticals for help. What’s her best option?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "719861_2",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
  ]
